  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Coordination on Migration Governance in Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is part of the broader &#x201c;Migration &amp; Diaspora Programme (PMD)&#x201d;. The objective of the project will be to support the Government of Albania in reinforcing the national migration policy and governance in the country. The project will provide support for the establishment of the coordination and monitoring mechanism of the National Strategy on Migration 2019-2022 (NSM) and Action Plan (AP), as foreseen in the NSM.  The project includes policy advice and training on the development-oriented migration policies. Additionally, it will include peer-to-peer exchange and multi-stakeholder dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
